H1913A.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:27; 
son of: Joktan (H3355); 
brother of: Almodad (H0486), Sheleph (H8026), Hazarmaveth (H2700), Jerah (H3392), Uzal (H0187), Diklah (H1853), Obal (H5745), Abimael (H0039), Sheba (H7614H), Ophir (H0211), Havilah (H2341I) and Jobab (H3103)
§ Hadoram = "noble honour"
1) the 5th son of Joktan, an Arabian tribe
2) a son of Tou, king of Hamath, was his father's ambassador to congratulate David on his victory over Hadarezer, king of Zobah

H1919.def:
A woman living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esther 2:7; 
daughter of: Abihail (H0032K); also called Hadassah at Esther 2:7; 
Another name of es.ter (אֶסְתֵּר "Esther" H0635) 
§ Hadassah = "myrtle"
queen Esther's Jewish name

H1936.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:37; 
son of: Zophah (H6690); 
brother of: Suah (H5477), Harnepher (H2774), Shual (H7777B), Beri (H1275), Imrah (H3236), Bezer (H1221H), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030), Ithran (H3506H) and Beera (H0878) 
§ Hod = "splendour"
one of the sons of Zophah, among the descendants of Asher

H1950.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:22; 
son of: Lotan (H3877); 
brother of: Hori (H2753H)
Also named: he.mam (הֵימָם "Hemam" H1967) 
§ Homam = "confusion"
a descendant of Seir the Horite, the son of Lotan

H1953.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:18; 
son of: Shealtiel (H7597A)(?); 
brother of: Shealtiel (H7597A)(?), Malchiram (H4443), Pedaiah (H6305H), Shenazzar (H8137), Jekamiah (H3359H) and Nedabiah (H5072) 
§ Hoshama = "whom Jehovah hears"
one of the sons of Jeconiah or Jehoiachin, the next to last king of Judah

H1956.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 25:4; 
son of: Heman (H1968I); 
brother of: Bukkiah (H1232), Mattaniah (H4983H), Uzziel (H5816J), Shebuel (H7619H), Jerimoth (H3406L), Hananiah (H2608P), Hanani (H2607H), Eliathah (H0448), Giddalti (H1437), Romamti-ezer (H7320), Joshbekashah (H3436), Mallothi (H4413), Mahazioth (H4238) 
§ Hothir = "abundance"
the 13th son of Heman and a Kohathite Levite

H1967.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:22; 
son of: Lotan (H3877); 
brother of: Hori (H2753H)
Another spelling of ho.mam (הוֹמָ֑ם "Hemam" H1950) 
§ Hemam = "exterminating"
a son of Lotan, brother of Hori, and grandson of Seir

H1987.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:32; 
son of: Heber (H2268); 
brother of: Japhlet (H3310), Shomer (H7763H) and Shua (H7774); 
father of: Zophah (H6690), Imna (H3234), Shelesh (H8028) and Amal (H6000); also called Helem at 1 Chroniques 7:35; 
Another name of cho.tam (חוֹתָם "Hotham" H2369G) 
§ Helem = "smiter"
a descendant of Asher
